Hi Asmi,

Tomorrow, TigerGraph will reveal what more than 300 independently developed=
 enterprise AI applications taught us about GraphRAG.

The results were striking. GraphRAG reduced token consumption by an average=
 of 80.7% and by as much as 94.6% while improving accuracy by 35%.

But the benchmark also revealed something more important: where GraphRAG wi=
ns, where it does not, and why.

