Date: Wednesday, August 26th Time: 10:00 AM PT / 1:00 PM ET

You will learn:

- Why text-based retrieval creates redundant context
- Where connected evidence delivers the greatest gains
- How graph traversals become concise evidence packages
- Why retrieval architecture improves efficiency and accuracy
- When GraphRAG or Vector RAG is the right choice

This is not another theoretical comparison of retrieval technologies. It is=
 a practical look at what hundreds of real GraphRAG applications revealed.

Join us tomorrow.

