<p style=3D"font-size:14px; line-height:125%">Hi Asmi,</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:100%; font-size:14px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:1.2"><span style=3D"font-size: 14px;">Tomorrow, Tig=
erGraph will reveal what more than 300 independently developed enterprise A=
I applications taught us about GraphRAG.</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:100%; font-size:14px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:1.2"><span style=3D"font-size: 14px;">The results w=
ere striking. GraphRAG reduced token consumption by an average of 80.7% and=
 by as much as 94.6% while improving accuracy by 35%.</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:100%; font-size:14px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:1.2"><span style=3D"font-size: 14px;">But the bench=
mark also revealed something more important: where GraphRAG wins, where it =
does not, and why.</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:100%; font-size:14px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:1.39"><span style=3D"font-size: 14px;"><a href=3D"h=
